From: Dave Cook <dave.cook@siemens.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Jun 2025 10:31:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Update for audio support

- Use the configured qemu pipewire device input and output names as the node names. We can then uniquely identify them when multiple VPs are running
- Qemu-side fix for AT1-4141 - Audio : volume control / mute not working in audio
- Fix for AT1-4429 Warnings in QEMU audio device after change to add support for controls

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [custom implementation]
